Cell["\<\
All self-energies act on the final layer. Diagonal Green blocks are returned \
in the original layer order.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->1167952211,ExpressionUUID->"2be7c9fa-cb77-0741-8ea3-89528b693527"],

